// Nothing to change. The create failing once after role creation is IAM
// propagation, not a wrong policy. The correct response is a bounded retry
// with backoff on the create. Rebuilding the trust policy or switching
// stores 'fixes' a bug that was never there and leaves the real one — a
// missing retry — in place.
